Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.80,0:00:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon the intrusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.45,0:00:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Shinpei, are you still staying up like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.72,0:00:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.66,0:00:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.91,0:00:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,However, please get some sleep as well, Master Shinpei.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.05,0:00:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I will watch over her in your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.80,0:00:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm used to not sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.90,0:00:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to stay by her side.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.40,0:00:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.20,0:00:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.76,0:00:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Satoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.90,0:00:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stay by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.96,0:00:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare die on me.
